Package: gq
Title: One Set of Map Styles for QGIS, Report Figures and Web Maps
Version: 0.20.0
Date: 2026-11-13
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128",
                       affiliation = "New Graph Environment Ltd.")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Keeps the map styles of QGIS field projects in one registry,
    extracted from the projects themselves, and translates them into
    'tmap' arguments for figures in reports and 'MapLibre GL' paint
    properties for web maps, so a layer keeps the colours and line widths
    QGIS gives it. The QGIS style files ship alongside, for anything that
    draws with QGIS itself. Under active development.
